# Company & Product Context

When sibling `loyalty-cursor/company/` exists, read `loyalty-cursor/company/README.md` before product, scope or prioritization work.

## Source of truth

| Topic | File |
| --- | --- |
| Company index | `loyalty-cursor/company/README.md` |
| Product backlog | `loyalty-cursor/company/future-work/README.md` |
| Story registry | `loyalty-cursor/company/future-work/STORY-REGISTRY.md` |
| Full-stack stories | `loyalty-cursor/analysis/features/` |
| This repo's stories | `cursor/analysis/features/` |
