Do not invent backlog IDs. Ticket/story is usually JIRA `LOY-*`. Backlog ID is `FW-LOY-*` when promoted.

If `loyalty-cursor/` is not in the workspace, use this repo's `cursor/company/README.md` and `docs/` only.
